      "type": "VAGUENESS",
      "severity": "MEDIUM",
      "location": "§22",
      "proposalQuote": "Aimpoint will collaborate with MPSC and the State to coordinate project meetings as needed to support this effort.",
      "explanation": "Deferring meeting coordination without defining a baseline cadence or structure creates ambiguity around governance expectations.",
      "fix": "Specify a recurring baseline schedule (e.g., bi-weekly or monthly) for project meetings rather than stating as needed."
    }
  ],
  "scores": [
    {
      "id": "scope_clarity",
      "label": "Scope & Deliverables Clarity",
      "score": 4,
      "strengths": "The proposal delineates specific support activities across DevOps, CI/CD pipelines, release readiness, and business specifications within the 600-hour boundary.",
      "weaknesses": "In §24, the vendor seeks an informal exemption from SUITE documentation without precisely establishing an agreed boundary for compliance.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "proposal",
          "section": "§14",
          "quote": "Aimpoint will provide annual support for three existing Salesforce applications, with 200 hours allocated per application per year."
        },
        {
          "source": "proposal",
          "section": "§24",
          "quote": "Aimpoint requests an exemption from the full SUITE documentation requirements and proposes a streamlined approach"
        }
      ],
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pricing_clarity",
      "label": "Pricing Clarity",
      "score": 1,
      "strengths": null,
